  m_text: 'There is unrest in the Galactic Senate. Several thousand solar systems
    have declared their intentions to leave the Republic.


    This Separatist
    movement, under the leadership of the mysterious Count Dooku, has made it difficult
    for the limited number of Jedi Knights to maintain peace and order in the galaxy.


    Senator
    Amidala, the former Queen of Naboo, is returning to the Galactic Senate to vote
    on the critical issue of creating an ARMY OF THE REPUBLIC to assist the overwhelmed
    Jedi....'
